/usr/local/lib/exiftool/lib/Image/ExifTool/Geolocation.dat, the city
database ExifTool reads for the geolocation feature, is derived from the
GeoNames cities data (https://www.geonames.org/). ExifTool keeps the cities
with a population of 2000 or more and stores them in its own format.

